5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:15,640
Rosa Delgado is in the CRM twice: same phone, same address.

6
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:18,440
Alex clicks Approve merge.

7
00:00:18,520 --> 00:00:23,473
The record keeps who approved it, the time, and the history.

8
00:00:23,553 --> 00:00:27,073
This week: the mentoring kids at risk, each with a draft follow-up.

9
00:00:27,153 --> 00:00:30,873
Alex approves Kevin's follow-up.

10
00:00:30,953 --> 00:00:35,807
Status: approved by Alex, with the time. The owner now calls the parent.

11
00:00:35,887 --> 00:00:38,540
Q3 report: the numbers that funders ask for.

12
00:00:38,620 --> 00:00:42,040
All totals reconcile with the source rows.

13
00:00:42,120 --> 00:00:45,300
Each total is counted again from the raw rows, and every check matches.

